    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "An indicator is a substance that changes colour in acids and bases. Litmus paper turns red in acids and blue in bases.\nRed rose petal juice turns pink in acids and green in bases. Turmeric stays yellow in acids but turns red in bases such as soap.\nIndicators let us test substances safely without tasting them."
    }
